          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 97,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD reigns! Let the earth rejoice! Let the multitude of islands be glad!",
      "ko": "여호와께서 통치하시나니 땅은 즐거워하며 허다한 섬은 기뻐할찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "17a68f14c601d19aa8b4bf955880040e7943184cc7e90a054f6d7203c26a6280",
      "translation_text_hash": "7d9f67118b0b3b71cb501bcce2f9fef1575115c24502246add1cfb837a00b590",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 통치하시나니 땅은 즐거워하며 허다한 섬은 기뻐할찌어다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7d9f67118b0b3b71cb501bcce2f9fef1575115c24502246add1cfb837a00b590"
      ]
    },
