      "en": "The mountains melt like wax at the presence of the LORD, at the presence of the Lord of the whole earth.",
      "ko": "산들이 여호와의 앞 곧 온 땅의 주 앞에서 밀 같이 녹았도다",
      "source_text_hash": "11ebbc2732814dc310888c72de6e723701144b469b7f08e82eed38c33367c2b5",
      "translation_text_hash": "bb5632bd21cac5881a93800ef1a269f46339c3dd6115b60056b9d7f5cdace2d1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
